---
layout: ds-layout.njk
title: Figma 對照
description: Figma Variables、Components 與程式碼 token / 元件 ID 的對照表。
page:
  id: figma
permalink: figma/index.html
---

<section class="ds-section">
  <h2 class="ds-section__title">Token Sets</h2>
  <p class="ds-section__desc">Tokens Studio 匯出路徑需與下方一致。Plugin：<strong>{{ figma.plugin }}</strong></p>
  <table class="ds-table">
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Set ID</th><th>名稱</th><th>檔案</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for set in figma.tokenSets %}
      <tr>
        <td><code>{{ set.id }}</code></td>
        <td>{{ set.label }}</td>
        <td><code>{{ set.file }}</code></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</section>

<section class="ds-section">
  <h2 class="ds-section__title">Figma Variables ↔ CSS</h2>
  <table class="ds-table">
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Figma Variable</th><th>Token Path</th><th>CSS Variable</th><th>語意色</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for row in figma.figmaVariables %}
      <tr>
        <td><code>{{ row.figma }}</code></td>
        <td><code>{{ row.token }}</code></td>
        <td><code>{{ row.cssVar }}</code></td>
        <td>{% if row.semantic %}<code>{{ row.semantic }}</code>{% else %}—{% endif %}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</section>

<section class="ds-section">
  <h2 class="ds-section__title">Figma Components ↔ 程式碼</h2>
  <table class="ds-table">
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Figma Component</th><th>Code ID</th><th>CMS Block</th><th>Variants</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for row in figma.figmaComponents %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ row.figma }}</td>
        <td><a href="/design-system/components/#{{ row.codeId }}"><code>{{ row.codeId }}</code></a></td>
        <td>{% if row.cmsBlock %}<code>{{ row.cmsBlock }}</code>{% else %}—{% endif %}</td>
        <td>{% if row.variants %}{{ row.variants | join(', ') }}{% else %}—{% endif %}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</section>

<section class="ds-section">
  <h2 class="ds-section__title">設計師工作流程（Figma → Code）</h2>
  <ol class="ds-steps">
    {% for step in figma.workflowDesigner %}
    <li>{{ step }}</li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
  <p class="ds-section__desc">固定指令：<code>/figma-sync</code> · 設定檔：<code>scripts/figma-config.json</code></p>
</section>

<section class="ds-section">
  <h2 class="ds-section__title">Token 匯出（可選 Tokens Studio）</h2>
  <ol class="ds-steps">
    {% for step in figma.workflowTokensStudioOptional %}
    <li>{{ step }}</li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
</section>

<section class="ds-section">
  <h2 class="ds-section__title">Figma 檔案結構建議</h2>
  <pre class="ds-code"><code>{{ figma.figmaFileName }}.fig
├── Tokens/          Variables + Tokens Studio sync
├── Components/      Actions · Navigation · Content · Blocks · Forms
└── Page Templates/    對應 WIREFRAME-BLOCKS.md 各頁</code></pre>
</section>
